      "writtenOn": "2025-02-28T02:02:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@dsrbecky@google.com, would you be able to show me a piece of code that creates a `VdexFile` instance with a `DexFile` entry that\u0027s authentic enough to go from `VdexFile::Open` into this function? Thanks.",
      "parentUuid": "dbf5a193_8f2be027",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 215,
        "startChar": 0,
