      "writtenOn": "2025-02-28T23:04:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re the dex validity check, there\u0027s also the aspect that a vdex with invalid dex\u0027es will get partially used, instead of discarded directly at the start. That may open less trodden code paths, and Nicolas seemed less keen on it when I mentioned it on https://r.android.com/3482652.\n\nRe testing, thanks for the tips. That could be one option but in the interest of time I\u0027ll submit this and leave that for later.",
      "parentUuid": "5f03aef6_fa5b62d4",
